            <div class="text-center pageNewsDetailsTitle">
                <h1>Precautions&nbsp;of&nbsp;dc&nbsp;to&nbsp;ac&nbsp;solar&nbsp;power&nbsp;inverter&nbsp;installation&nbsp;for&nbsp;home</h1>
                <div class="publish marginAuto">
                    <ul>
                        <li class="pull-left t1"><a class="post-981"></a></li>
                        <span class="pull-left hidden-xs"></span>
                        <li class="pull-left padding hidden-xs">Published by</li>
                        <li class="pull-left t2">Xindun</li>
                        <li class="pull-left t3">September 25, 2020</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 新闻标题结束 -->
            <!-- 搜索及分享开始 -->
                        <!-- 搜索及分享结束 -->
                <style>
                    .addthis_inline_share_toolbox_q1or{
                        float: right;
                    }
                </style>
            <!-- 新闻内容开始 -->
            <div class="container-fluid clearfix">
                <div class="row pageNewsDetailsBox">
                    <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
                        <div class="thumbnail clearPic">
                                                                                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;"><a href="https://www.xindun-power.com/pure-sine-wave-inverter/LS-Inverter-For-Solar-System-1KW-2KW-3KW.html" target="_blank">Solar power inverters</a> are electrical equipment, improper installation will cause serious consequences. Installation precautions when installing the inverter mainly include:</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">1) The installation place should be well ventilated, away from water, flammable gas and corrosive agents.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">2) Do not put it on its side. Keep the air inlet under the front panel, the fan outlet of the rear cover and the air inlet on the side of the box unobstructed.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">3) The ambient temperature is maintained at 0-40 degrees.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">4) If it is disassembled and used at low temperature, water droplets may condense. You must wait until the inside and outside are completely dry before installing and using, otherwise there is a danger of electric shock.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">5) If the machine is placed out of use for a long time, it can be installed and used after confirming that the machine is completely dry and free of corrosion.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">6) Please leave a space of 10 cm around the inverter to make the air unblocked.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;">7) Other precautions of dc to ac solar power inverter installation for home, read the manual for details.</span><o:p></o:p>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="">
	<span style="font-size:14px;"><br />
</span>
</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="font-size:14px;"><a href="https://www.xindun-power.com/pure-sine-wave-inverter/LS-Inverter-For-Solar-System-1KW-2KW-3KW.html" target="_blank"><img src="/uploadfile/upload/2020-09/25/anzhuang.jpg" title="安装" alt="安装" /></a><br />
</span>
</p>                                                    </div>
